WEBVTT

00:01.560 --> 00:03.830
It's not like he disappeared on me.

00:04.370 --> 00:06.230
The shard is definitely here.

00:07.200 --> 00:09.170
But I can't feel him...

00:11.570 --> 00:13.740
We'll take you by force if need be.

00:13.740 --> 00:18.870
We cannot allow those who have violated
Absolute Law to go free.

00:19.580 --> 00:21.380
Why you...

00:34.630 --> 00:42.240
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:42.240 --> 00:45.410
Utatte iru

00:45.410 --> 00:53.050
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

00:53.050 --> 00:56.320
Shimaikonde

00:56.320 --> 01:06.900
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:06.900 --> 01:12.330
Ayumou

01:12.330 --> 01:17.740
Susumou

01:17.740 --> 01:22.580
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:22.580 --> 01:28.050
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:28.050 --> 01:33.520
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:33.520 --> 01:38.760
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:38.760 --> 01:42.790
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:44.430 --> 01:47.960
Atashi wa ikite yuku

01:53.040 --> 01:56.670
Episode 34
War Breaks Out

01:58.910 --> 02:01.380
Zed, you look lost in thought.

02:01.380 --> 02:02.880
Is something wrong?

02:02.880 --> 02:06.510
Nah, it's nothing.

02:07.160 --> 02:09.060
You saved me there.

02:09.060 --> 02:12.530
Thanks, um...

02:12.530 --> 02:14.590
Helic of Ulvarx.

02:15.460 --> 02:17.260
Yeah, that's right.

02:20.140 --> 02:23.140
This is Neotopia, isn't it?

02:23.140 --> 02:24.210
Yes...

02:24.210 --> 02:26.300
What are you all doing here?

02:27.240 --> 02:29.880
There's something I'd like to talk to you about.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.850
Please come with me.

02:43.020 --> 02:44.630
Why not?!

02:44.630 --> 02:47.600
We have to go into Neotopia quickly!

02:47.600 --> 02:50.560
Zed's life is in danger at this rate!

02:52.800 --> 02:55.040
Why won't you say anything?

02:55.040 --> 02:58.770
And I want to see Master Zico, not you!

02:58.770 --> 03:00.440
You cannot.

03:00.440 --> 03:02.240
But why not?!

03:11.490 --> 03:12.620
Zico...

03:12.620 --> 03:14.360
Sebastian!

03:14.360 --> 03:18.950
What is the meaning of them locking
me up in a cell like this?

03:20.230 --> 03:26.370
Zico, if I were to let you out of this
cell right now, what then?

03:26.370 --> 03:28.140
That's obvious enough!

03:28.140 --> 03:32.140
I would go straight to Neotopia and try
once more to convince Hyrum to...

03:32.140 --> 03:37.770
You are forbidden from setting foot
in Neotopia in any way!

03:39.380 --> 03:43.480
Do you understand what's happening?

03:43.480 --> 03:45.750
Even as we speak, Zed is...

03:45.750 --> 03:48.390
I know how you feel.

03:48.390 --> 03:50.760
But with a situation like this,

03:50.760 --> 03:56.360
we must be prudent in dealing with Neotopia,
which is our ally.

03:56.360 --> 04:01.500
We cannot risk endangering our country
for the sake of one person!

04:03.270 --> 04:06.070
Do you mean what you say?

04:08.510 --> 04:12.450
The life of a country is no different
than the life of an individual.

04:12.450 --> 04:14.920
If we stand idly by now,

04:14.920 --> 04:17.890
we are sure to regret it later.

04:34.400 --> 04:37.640
Everything is flawless,
even if this is just a rehearsal.

04:37.640 --> 04:39.940
Today's Foundation Day ceremony should be
something to look forward to,

04:39.940 --> 04:41.110
wouldn't you say, Your Holiness?

04:41.110 --> 04:42.180
Indeed...

04:42.180 --> 04:47.310
A fully choreographed performance is
a truly beautiful sight to behold.

04:48.420 --> 04:56.690
Incidentally, those vile outlaws from Ulvarx who
attacked me the other day are still in hiding.

04:56.690 --> 04:59.290
Is it your wish that we dispose of them?

04:59.290 --> 05:01.600
This is not all they have done.

05:01.600 --> 05:07.700
They also attacked Chavez's squad, which was
bringing in a lawbreaker from Templar,

05:07.700 --> 05:09.870
and ran off with the prisoner.

05:09.870 --> 05:11.740
A lawbreaker?

05:11.740 --> 05:14.040
Yes, Zed.

05:15.640 --> 05:18.810
Find them before the commencement
of today's ceremony,

05:18.810 --> 05:21.480
and punish them all.

05:21.480 --> 05:23.720
That, of course, includes Zed.

05:23.720 --> 05:25.520
Yes, Your Holiness.

05:33.460 --> 05:35.930
Oh, I messed up.

05:36.730 --> 05:38.130
Will you be okay?

05:38.130 --> 05:40.600
Today's the day, you know.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.740
I'll give it a little more practice.

05:44.740 --> 05:48.110
But you'll have to be home on time.

05:48.110 --> 05:50.310
Yeah, okay.

05:50.310 --> 05:55.180
I'll do my best so that I'll be able to play it
perfectly for you at the performance.

05:55.180 --> 05:58.720
Okay, and I'll be looking forward to it.

05:58.720 --> 06:00.350
Noah!

06:01.890 --> 06:03.760
How long are you going to be here?

06:03.760 --> 06:05.060
Hurry up!

06:05.060 --> 06:07.530
Yeah, all right.

06:09.030 --> 06:11.830
Where are you going, Noah?

06:12.730 --> 06:14.140
I'm sorry.

06:14.140 --> 06:19.100
I wanted to watch longer,
but I'm busy with watch duties.

06:19.810 --> 06:21.610
Will you be late?

06:21.610 --> 06:23.410
It will be all right.

06:23.410 --> 06:25.540
I'll be back in no time.

06:35.760 --> 06:36.860
You should have seen his face then!

06:36.860 --> 06:38.230
None of us started out as shard casters.
You should have seen his face then!

06:38.230 --> 06:40.020
None of us started out as shard casters.

06:40.600 --> 06:46.060
We became shard casters after having
our bodies partially mechanized.

06:47.000 --> 06:49.540
In order to defend yourselves?

06:49.540 --> 06:51.010
That's one reason,

06:51.010 --> 06:55.180
but our primary objective is to overthrow Hyrum!

06:55.180 --> 06:58.610
Hyrum? Why?

06:58.610 --> 07:04.650
Hyrum claims that his Absolute Law
will bring peace to all territories.

07:04.650 --> 07:06.780
But that is a lie!

07:07.820 --> 07:13.780
He's made many, many people suffer
in the name of his absurd law.

07:14.200 --> 07:16.530
So much blood has been spilled...

07:16.530 --> 07:19.000
So many of my comrades have fallen!

07:19.630 --> 07:23.300
They dispose of anyone who breaks
their Absolute Law.

07:23.300 --> 07:25.840
There are no exceptions.

07:25.840 --> 07:27.480
The guilty were murdered,

07:27.480 --> 07:32.310
and their entire clans exiled into
the remote territory of Ulvarx.

07:32.310 --> 07:34.280
Their whole clans too?

07:34.280 --> 07:37.750
Yes, all of them people who had
committed no misdeeds whatsoever.

07:37.750 --> 07:41.050
They were punished for being
"jointly responsible. "

07:42.960 --> 07:46.960
The storms raged there day after day,

07:46.960 --> 07:49.060
and there was neither food to eat
nor water to drink.

07:49.060 --> 07:51.360
It was a hellish land.

07:52.530 --> 07:53.970
But over many years,

07:53.970 --> 07:58.910
a group of people in that land amassed power
using only their technical capabilities,

07:58.910 --> 08:01.610
and swore vengeance on Hyrum.

08:01.610 --> 08:07.320
These were former Neotopian scientists,
led by Doctor Vendar.

08:07.320 --> 08:08.980
Doctor Vendar?

08:08.980 --> 08:10.850
Yes...

08:10.850 --> 08:14.650
I requested that the doctor mechanize my body,

08:15.220 --> 08:17.850
so that I could get revenge on Hyrum!

08:26.470 --> 08:28.000
What's wrong?

08:28.000 --> 08:29.970
Let's give the horses some rest.

08:31.010 --> 08:32.800
You're too laid back.

08:38.310 --> 08:40.150
What are you thinking about?

08:40.150 --> 08:42.050
Nothing, really.

08:42.050 --> 08:44.950
Is it about that Zed fellow?

08:44.950 --> 08:47.420
He was a good friend of yours, right?

08:47.820 --> 08:49.450
Yeah...

08:50.630 --> 08:55.430
It's true that Zed helped me out with a lot
of things back when we were young.

08:55.430 --> 08:58.430
He was definitely someone you
could call a good friend.

08:58.430 --> 09:01.890
I wanted to be like him.

09:04.670 --> 09:06.470
But now...

09:07.280 --> 09:11.880
I want to surpass him.

09:11.880 --> 09:12.950
I see,

09:12.950 --> 09:16.250
then this may be your perfect opportunity.

09:17.250 --> 09:22.420
If you kill Zed, you will have surpassed him.

09:22.420 --> 09:23.490
You've got it wrong!

09:23.490 --> 09:26.620
I don't want to kill Zed!

09:28.400 --> 09:30.870
I want to surpass him,

09:30.870 --> 09:33.030
but at the same time,

09:33.030 --> 09:37.660
I'd like us to be together like we used to be.

09:40.210 --> 09:42.180
Maybe I contradict myself.

09:43.180 --> 09:45.450
I think so.

09:45.450 --> 09:49.680
You probably can't understand
how I feel, can you?

09:49.680 --> 09:52.650
No, I think I do have an idea.

09:54.260 --> 09:58.560
I have things I'd like to forget,

09:58.560 --> 10:03.520
but these are also things that I must never forget.

10:08.400 --> 10:12.970
The thing that helped us recover and
thrive in that hellish environment

10:12.970 --> 10:17.810
was the desire to someday defeat Hyrum.

10:17.810 --> 10:21.150
That's how I view it, at least.

10:21.150 --> 10:24.750
I will bring him down with my own hands,
no matter what,

10:24.750 --> 10:27.720
even if it means sacrificing my own body!

10:29.260 --> 10:34.720
Hyrum has brought tragedy upon so many,
all in the name of his Absolute Law.

10:35.530 --> 10:39.470
Those four have all lost their families.

10:39.470 --> 10:41.970
I have lost my own family as well,

10:41.970 --> 10:45.270
but I do have just one sibling who
might still be alive!

10:46.170 --> 10:48.440
I have a little sister,

10:48.440 --> 10:51.570
whom I was separated from when
I was exiled from Neotopia.

10:52.550 --> 10:54.170
Chelsia...

10:54.620 --> 10:57.080
I'm sure she's still alive somewhere in this land.

10:57.790 --> 10:59.490
Little sister?

10:59.490 --> 11:03.290
My sister has a birthmark just like mine.

11:07.160 --> 11:13.500
I was actually parented by Absolute Law,
from as early as I can remember,

11:13.500 --> 11:15.970
because I had no other family.

11:16.570 --> 11:21.140
Years ago, an uncle of mine
violated Absolute Law.

11:21.140 --> 11:25.510
As a result, my whole clan was
exiled from Neotopia.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.950
Exiled?

11:26.950 --> 11:28.380
Except for me.

11:28.380 --> 11:30.690
On the strength of my potential as a shard caster,

11:30.690 --> 11:32.810
I was placed in a Neotopian facility.

11:33.550 --> 11:37.460
I remember very little about that time,

11:37.460 --> 11:41.830
but I do have a vague memory
of my older brother.

11:41.830 --> 11:44.130
He was my only brother.

11:44.970 --> 11:47.000
So, you had an older brother?

11:47.000 --> 11:50.340
I must not think about those who were banished.

11:50.340 --> 11:54.140
To do so would be to betray Holy Father Hyrum.

11:54.140 --> 11:55.770
But...

11:56.410 --> 12:00.880
I just can't forget my brother's warmth.

12:00.880 --> 12:05.340
Even now, my hands still remember
the warmth of his.

12:06.750 --> 12:08.380
Kira...

12:10.660 --> 12:11.860
Pardon me.

12:11.860 --> 12:13.560
That was more than you needed to hear.

12:13.560 --> 12:15.360
Let's move on.

12:34.680 --> 12:36.250
This is promising.

12:36.250 --> 12:37.790
With a force like this,

12:37.790 --> 12:41.740
it won't take us even three days
to conquer Neotopia.

12:42.890 --> 12:47.660
I, King of Tusk, am personally
riding into this battle.

12:47.660 --> 12:49.960
Failure is not an option.

12:49.960 --> 12:52.260
Do not forget that!

12:54.570 --> 12:56.700
Thus spoke the puppet king.

12:57.240 --> 13:01.200
Go! Make Neotopia our domain!

13:14.760 --> 13:18.230
The project is behind by
approximately eight percent.

13:18.230 --> 13:21.400
Catch back up within the next day or two.

13:21.400 --> 13:23.190
Ma'am.

13:26.970 --> 13:29.870
This Stupa is a symbol of the Absolute Justice
that Holy Father Hyrum,

13:29.870 --> 13:36.170
or rather, Neotopia itself,
shall bring to all territories.

13:37.040 --> 13:40.170
It must be finished without delay.

14:05.710 --> 14:08.510
Well? Have you found any clues?

14:08.510 --> 14:11.050
We are about to reach a place
that appears to be it,

14:11.050 --> 14:13.250
but there has not been any sort of reaction.

14:13.250 --> 14:14.750
I see.

14:14.750 --> 14:17.180
Well, I'm counting on you to continue the search.

14:17.180 --> 14:18.810
Yes, ma'am.

14:27.330 --> 14:30.960
There are signs that a spell shard
has been used and...

14:31.930 --> 14:33.970
there are these bloodstains as well.

14:33.970 --> 14:36.340
It seems certain.

14:36.340 --> 14:41.640
There was a skirmish here, and Zed
was detained by the Ulvarxans.

14:43.040 --> 14:48.680
If that's true, then it's possible they are
in hiding not too far from here.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.220
Those are...

14:52.220 --> 14:54.190
Beastmen from Tusk!

14:57.220 --> 14:58.590
No doubt about it!

14:58.590 --> 15:01.060
Tusk has launched a surprise attack on us!

15:01.060 --> 15:02.530
Then it was true after all.

15:02.530 --> 15:07.660
Our defense system to guard against enemy
attacks has indeed been compromised.

15:09.170 --> 15:14.040
Kira, you return to the castle and report
this to Holy Father Hyrum!

15:14.040 --> 15:17.680
All right, but what of our mission?

15:17.680 --> 15:19.810
This is an emergency.

15:19.810 --> 15:22.380
Let me handle the pursuit of the Ulvarxans.

15:22.380 --> 15:23.650
You hurry to the castle!

15:23.650 --> 15:25.450
All right!

15:32.590 --> 15:35.900
I witnessed your strength in the Joust,

15:35.900 --> 15:39.200
and the strength of that great key spirit of yours.

15:40.230 --> 15:44.140
Hyrum's Absolute Law couldn't
be more hypocritical,

15:44.140 --> 15:47.540
or bring greater misfortune to so many.

15:47.540 --> 15:50.510
I beg you, please help us!

15:51.380 --> 15:53.910
I don't have that kind of power now.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.020
What?

15:55.020 --> 15:57.640
My Amir Gaul is...

16:00.590 --> 16:02.320
Yes, that's what it looks like.

16:02.320 --> 16:04.220
You can tell?

16:04.220 --> 16:10.200
You didn't attempt to use Amir Gaul when you
were attacked by the Neotopian troops either.

16:10.200 --> 16:12.600
I thought it was odd.

16:12.600 --> 16:14.500
So, you noticed?

16:14.500 --> 16:17.040
It seems we know more than others about shards,

16:17.040 --> 16:20.870
since we've researched them so thoroughly.

16:20.870 --> 16:23.840
Amir Gaul will awaken eventually.

16:23.840 --> 16:25.640
Seriously?

16:25.980 --> 16:29.110
So, I want you to help us if at all possible.

16:30.250 --> 16:32.220
Please think it over.

16:38.560 --> 16:40.360
Awaken?

16:43.230 --> 16:44.930
Shifting?

16:44.930 --> 16:46.730
The beastmen?!

16:56.010 --> 16:57.980
Where are they headed?

17:00.380 --> 17:02.010
Rambos!

17:21.500 --> 17:24.470
So, this is indeed where you were hiding.

17:58.470 --> 18:00.440
I won't let you interfere!

18:04.810 --> 18:06.610
It can't be!

18:21.130 --> 18:22.930
Stop it, Noah!

18:23.760 --> 18:25.560
Stop it now.

18:26.470 --> 18:31.640
I have come here to punish the guilty
in the name of Absolute Law.

18:31.640 --> 18:33.370
What?!

18:33.370 --> 18:36.940
That includes you, Zed.

18:36.940 --> 18:38.650
What?

18:38.650 --> 18:41.920
There are no exceptions to Absolute Law.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.710
That again, huh?

19:12.510 --> 19:14.980
I absolutely will not let them get to the castle!

19:27.860 --> 19:30.990
It's Tusk! Beastmen from Tusk!

19:39.510 --> 19:42.130
Noah, where are you?

19:55.960 --> 20:02.420
On behalf of Zymot,
I hereby declare war upon Neotopia!

20:14.010 --> 20:15.010
This is bad!

20:15.010 --> 20:17.980
If I don't hurry, they'll invade the castle!

20:24.320 --> 20:27.950
It's beastmen and Zymotan soldiers?!

20:28.790 --> 20:30.590
What's going on here?

20:33.930 --> 20:37.390
I've seen you before, at the Joust.

20:38.470 --> 20:42.420
You're Elmeida from Zymot, if I recall.

20:42.900 --> 20:45.370
To think that you'd remember my name!

20:45.370 --> 20:48.280
You've got promise.

20:48.280 --> 20:51.570
Makes it almost seem like a
waste that you'll die here.

20:52.280 --> 20:54.410
Tusk and Zymot joining forces...

20:55.520 --> 20:57.640
Just what is your aim?

20:59.790 --> 21:01.690
Isn't that kind of obvious?

21:01.690 --> 21:03.490
War, honey.

21:06.830 --> 21:09.800
Why do I have to fight you?

21:10.730 --> 21:16.000
Noah, I've got no idea what you're thinking.

21:16.000 --> 21:21.610
That is because you make no attempt to
comprehend the magnificence of Absolute Law!

21:21.610 --> 21:23.180
That again?

21:23.180 --> 21:24.750
Give it up already!

21:24.750 --> 21:28.370
If you don't understand, I'll teach you by force!

21:35.760 --> 21:39.890
I can see you have no intention of
fighting me with all you've got.

21:40.790 --> 21:42.590
All right then...

21:48.240 --> 21:50.030
The city...

21:52.070 --> 21:54.680
Neotopia is...

21:54.680 --> 21:57.800
There were a whole bunch of beastmen
headed that way earlier.

21:58.580 --> 22:00.880
I must return to the castle at once!

22:06.320 --> 22:08.560
The Zymot army too?!

22:08.560 --> 22:10.160
What's happening?

22:10.160 --> 22:12.460
You want me to tell you?

22:15.400 --> 22:18.190
You're Nudyu from Zymot!

22:20.030 --> 22:22.800
It's finally started!

22:22.800 --> 22:25.100
The war's begun!

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:12.050
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.760 --> 23:24.030
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.030 --> 23:26.700
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.870 --> 23:31.510
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:17.420 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Ones Who Are Sacrificed

24:17.980 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Ones Who are Sacrificed"
